/// (≈10 s at 20 TPS). Authoring sets `wardrobe_dirty`; this batches rapid edits
/// into one write rather than saving on every pin/rename. The world exit hooks
/// flush immediately regardless, so nothing is lost on leave.
const WARDROBE_SAVE_DEBOUNCE_TICKS: u32 = 200;

